select t.id, v.lid, v.type, v.level, v.payload::jsonb, v.pos, 'book', v.sub from t, (values
  ($g1616$cond_ex10_1$g1616$, $g1617$abcd$g1617$, $g1618$intermediate$g1618$, $g1619${"id":"cond_ex10_1","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":1,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"1. You didn't watch the news so you didn't know there was a train strike. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I had watched the news. If I had watched the news, I would have known there was a train strike.","B) I wish I watched the news. If I watched the news, I would know there was a train strike.","C) I wish I had watched the news. If I watched the news, I would have known there was a train strike.","D) I wish I would watch the news. If I had watched the news, I would know there was a train strike."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Минуле: wish + Past Perfect, if + Past Perfect, наслідок would have + V3."}$g1619$, 40, $g1620$cond_wish$g1620$),
  ($g1621$cond_ex10_2$g1621$, $g1622$abcd$g1622$, $g1623$intermediate$g1623$, $g1624${"id":"cond_ex10_2","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":2,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"2. You work long hours and you can't spend much time with your family. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I didn't work such long hours. If I didn't work long hours, I could spend more time with my family.","B) I wish I hadn't worked long hours. If I hadn't worked long hours, I could have spent more time with my family.","C) I wish I wouldn't work long hours. If I didn't work long hours, I would spend more time with my family.","D) I wish I didn't work long hours. If I don't work long hours, I could spend more time with my family."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple, if + Past Simple, could/would + V. Про себе I wish I wouldn't не кажемо."}$g1624$, 41, $g1625$cond_wish$g1625$),
  ($g1626$cond_ex10_3$g1626$, $g1627$abcd$g1627$, $g1628$intermediate$g1628$, $g1629${"id":"cond_ex10_3","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":3,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"3. You wanted to travel abroad but you forgot to renew your passport. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I hadn't forgotten to renew my passport. If I had renewed my passport, I could have travelled abroad.","B) I wish I didn't forget to renew my passport. If I renewed my passport, I could travel abroad.","C) I wish I hadn't forgotten to renew my passport. If I renewed my passport, I could have travelled abroad.","D) I wish I wouldn't forget to renew my passport. If I had renewed my passport, I would travel abroad."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Минуле: Past Perfect в обох частинах. Wish і if-речення про одну ситуацію мають однаковий час: про минуле — Past Perfect, про теперішнє — Past Simple, у наслідку would/could."}$g1629$, 42, $g1630$cond_wish$g1630$),
  ($g1631$cond_ex10_4$g1631$, $g1632$abcd$g1632$, $g1633$intermediate$g1633$, $g1634${"id":"cond_ex10_4","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":4,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"4. You can't drive a car so you can't get around easily. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I could drive a car. If I could drive a car, I could get around easily.","B) I wish I can drive a car. If I can drive a car, I could get around easily.","C) I wish I could have driven a car. If I could have driven, I would have got around easily.","D) I wish I would drive a car. If I drove a car, I will get around easily."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Бракує вміння: wish + could. Нереальна умова теперішнього: If + could, could + V."}$g1634$, 43, $g1635$cond_wish$g1635$),
  ($g1636$cond_ex10_5$g1636$, $g1637$abcd$g1637$, $g1638$intermediate$g1638$, $g1639${"id":"cond_ex10_5","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":5,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"5. You wanted to play tennis but you broke your racquet. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I hadn't broken my racquet. If I hadn't broken my racquet, I could have played tennis.","B) I wish I didn't break my racquet. If I didn't break my racquet, I could play tennis.","C) I wish I hadn't broken my racquet. If I didn't break my racquet, I could have played tennis.","D) I wish I wouldn't break my racquet. If I hadn't broken it, I would play tennis."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Минуле: wish + Past Perfect, if + Past Perfect, наслідок could have + V3."}$g1639$, 44, $g1640$cond_wish$g1640$),
  ($g1641$cond_ex10_6$g1641$, $g1642$abcd$g1642$, $g1643$intermediate$g1643$, $g1644${"id":"cond_ex10_6","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":6,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"6. You want to go swimming but you have lost your swimming costume. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I hadn't lost my swimming costume. If I hadn't lost my swimming costume, I could go swimming.","B) I wish I didn't lose my swimming costume. If I didn't lose it, I could go swimming.","C) I wish I hadn't lost my swimming costume. If I hadn't lost it, I could have gone swimming.","D) I wish I haven't lost my swimming costume. If I haven't lost it, I can go swimming."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Втрата сталася в минулому (Past Perfect), а бажання поплавати — зараз, тому в наслідку could go. Це мішаний тип."}$g1644$, 45, $g1645$cond_wish$g1645$),
  ($g1646$cond_ex10_7$g1646$, $g1647$abcd$g1647$, $g1648$intermediate$g1648$, $g1649${"id":"cond_ex10_7","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":7,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"7. You want to climb the mountain but you are afraid of heights. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I weren't afraid of heights. If I weren't afraid of heights, I could climb the mountain.","B) I wish I hadn't been afraid of heights. If I hadn't been afraid of heights, I would have climbed the mountain.","C) I wish I wouldn't be afraid of heights. If I am not afraid of heights, I could climb the mountain.","D) I wish I am not afraid of heights. If I weren't afraid of heights, I can climb the mountain."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple (weren't / wasn't), if + Past Simple, could + V."}$g1649$, 46, $g1650$cond_wish$g1650$),
  ($g1651$cond_ex10_8$g1651$, $g1652$abcd$g1652$, $g1653$intermediate$g1653$, $g1654${"id":"cond_ex10_8","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":8,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"8. You didn't set your video correctly so you didn't record the film. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I had set the video correctly. If I had set the video correctly, I would have recorded the film.","B) I wish I set the video correctly. If I set the video correctly, I would record the film.","C) I wish I had set the video correctly. If I set the video correctly, I would have recorded the film.","D) I wish I would set the video correctly. If I had set it correctly, I would record the film."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Минуле: Past Perfect в обох частинах, наслідок would have + V3."}$g1654$, 47, $g1655$cond_wish$g1655$),
  ($g1656$cond_ex10_9$g1656$, $g1657$abcd$g1657$, $g1658$intermediate$g1658$, $g1659${"id":"cond_ex10_9","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":9,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"9. You want to go out tonight but you haven't got enough money. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I had enough money. If I had enough money, I could go out tonight.","B) I wish I would have enough money. If I would have enough money, I could go out tonight.","C) I wish I had had enough money. If I had had enough money, I could go out tonight.","D) I wish I have enough money. If I had enough money, I can go out tonight."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple, if + Past Simple, could + V. Would після if не вживаємо."}$g1659$, 48, $g1660$cond_wish$g1660$),
  ($g1661$cond_ex10_10$g1661$, $g1662$abcd$g1662$, $g1663$intermediate$g1663$, $g1664${"id":"cond_ex10_10","level":"intermediate","group":10,"gord":10,"no":10,"instruction":"Write sentences, as in the example: a wish sentence and an if-sentence for each situation.","q":"10. You want to cook an Italian meal but you have no pasta left. Яка пара речень правильна?","options":["A) I wish I had some pasta left. If I had some pasta left, I could cook an Italian meal.","B) I wish I had had some pasta left. If I had had some pasta, I would cook an Italian meal.","C) I wish I would have some pasta left. If I will have pasta, I could cook an Italian meal.","D) I wish I have some pasta left. If I had pasta, I could have cooked an Italian meal."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple, if + Past Simple, could + V."}$g1664$, 49, $g1665$cond_wish$g1665$),
  ($g1666$cond_ex13_1$g1666$, $g1667$abcd$g1667$, $g1668$elementary$g1668$, $g1669${"id":"cond_ex13_1","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":1,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"1. If Bob hadn't broken his leg, …","options":["A) he can come with us.","B) he would come with us last week.","C) he could have come with us.","D) he will have come with us."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Тип 3: If + Past Perfect → would / could have + V3."}$g1669$, 50, $g1670$cond_unreal$g1670$),
  ($g1671$cond_ex13_2$g1671$, $g1672$abcd$g1672$, $g1673$elementary$g1673$, $g1674${"id":"cond_ex13_2","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":2,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"2. If only he hadn't lied to Sally, …","options":["A) she won't be so upset.","B) she hadn't been so upset.","C) she wouldn't have been so upset.","D) she didn't have been upset."],"correct":2,"explanation":"If only + Past Perfect — жаль про минуле. Наслідок: would have + V3."}$g1674$, 51, $g1675$cond_unreal$g1675$),
  ($g1676$cond_ex13_3$g1676$, $g1677$abcd$g1677$, $g1678$elementary$g1678$, $g1679${"id":"cond_ex13_3","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":3,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"3. If John is in trouble, …","options":["A) I would have helped him.","B) I helped him.","C) I will help him.","D) I had helped him."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Реальна умова теперішнього: If + Present Simple → will + V."}$g1679$, 52, $g1680$cond_unreal$g1680$),
  ($g1681$cond_ex13_4$g1681$, $g1682$abcd$g1682$, $g1683$elementary$g1683$, $g1684${"id":"cond_ex13_4","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":4,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"4. If only she had more patience, …","options":["A) she would have been a better teacher yesterday.","B) she will be a better teacher.","C) she would be a better teacher.","D) she had been a better teacher."],"correct":2,"explanation":"If only + Past Simple — жаль про теперішнє. Наслідок: would + V."}$g1684$, 53, $g1685$cond_unreal$g1685$),
  ($g1686$cond_ex13_5$g1686$, $g1687$abcd$g1687$, $g1688$elementary$g1688$, $g1689${"id":"cond_ex13_5","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":5,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"5. If she had won the competition, …","options":["A) she would receive the prize yesterday.","B) she will receive the prize.","C) she would have received the prize.","D) she had received the prize."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Тип 3: If + Past Perfect → would have + V3."}$g1689$, 54, $g1690$cond_unreal$g1690$),
  ($g1691$cond_ex13_6$g1691$, $g1692$abcd$g1692$, $g1693$elementary$g1693$, $g1694${"id":"cond_ex13_6","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":6,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"6. If Ann had set the alarm, …","options":["A) she won't oversleep.","B) she wouldn't oversleep yesterday.","C) she wouldn't have overslept.","D) she hadn't overslept."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Тип 3: Past Perfect → would not have + V3."}$g1694$, 55, $g1695$cond_unreal$g1695$),
  ($g1696$cond_ex13_7$g1696$, $g1697$abcd$g1697$, $g1698$elementary$g1698$, $g1699${"id":"cond_ex13_7","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":7,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"7. If I hadn't left the oven on too long, …","options":["A) the cake won't burn.","B) the cake didn't burn.","C) the cake wouldn't have burnt.","D) the cake wouldn't burn yesterday."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Тип 3: наслідок would have + V3."}$g1699$, 56, $g1700$cond_unreal$g1700$),
  ($g1701$cond_ex13_8$g1701$, $g1702$abcd$g1702$, $g1703$elementary$g1703$, $g1704${"id":"cond_ex13_8","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":8,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"8. If only I had written down her phone number, …","options":["A) I can phone her yesterday.","B) I will phone her yesterday.","C) I could have phoned her yesterday.","D) I phoned her yesterday."],"correct":2,"explanation":"If only + Past Perfect — жаль про минуле. Наслідок: could have + V3."}$g1704$, 57, $g1705$cond_unreal$g1705$),
  ($g1706$cond_ex13_9$g1706$, $g1707$abcd$g1707$, $g1708$elementary$g1708$, $g1709${"id":"cond_ex13_9","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":9,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"9. If she hadn't been sitting in the sun all afternoon, …","options":["A) she won't get sunburnt.","B) she hadn't got sunburnt.","C) she wouldn't have got sunburnt.","D) she wouldn't get sunburnt yesterday."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Тип 3: наслідок would not have + V3."}$g1709$, 58, $g1710$cond_unreal$g1710$),
  ($g1711$cond_ex13_10$g1711$, $g1712$abcd$g1712$, $g1713$elementary$g1713$, $g1714${"id":"cond_ex13_10","level":"elementary","group":13,"gord":13,"no":10,"instruction":"Complete the following sentences. (Choose the correct ending.)","q":"10. If Tom hadn't forgotten to lock the door, …","options":["A) the thieves won't get in.","B) the thieves hadn't got in.","C) the thieves wouldn't have got in.","D) the thieves wouldn't get in last night."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Тип 3: If + Past Perfect → would not have + V3."}$g1714$, 59, $g1715$cond_unreal$g1715$),
  ($g1716$cond_ex15_1$g1716$, $g1717$abcd$g1717$, $g1718$advanced$g1718$, $g1719${"id":"cond_ex15_1","level":"advanced","group":15,"gord":15,"no":1,"instruction":"Read the following situations, then make sentences using would rather or had better.","q":"1. You want to play tennis not squash.","options":["A) I would rather play tennis than play squash.","B) I would rather to play tennis than to play squash.","C) I would rather playing tennis than playing squash.","D) I had better play tennis than squash."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Would rather + bare infinitive + than + bare infinitive."}$g1719$, 60, $g1720$cond_rather$g1720$),
  ($g1721$cond_ex15_2$g1721$, $g1722$abcd$g1722$, $g1723$advanced$g1723$, $g1724${"id":"cond_ex15_2","level":"advanced","group":15,"gord":15,"no":2,"instruction":"Read the following situations, then make sentences using would rather or had better.","q":"2. You don't want her to invite him to the party.","options":["A) I'd rather she didn't invite him to the party.","B) I'd rather she doesn't invite him to the party.","C) I'd rather she wouldn't invite him to the party.","D) I'd rather her not to invite him to the party."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Інший підмет після would rather: Past Simple про теперішнє й майбутнє."}$g1724$, 61, $g1725$cond_rather$g1725$),
  ($g1726$cond_ex15_3$g1726$, $g1727$abcd$g1727$, $g1728$advanced$g1728$, $g1729${"id":"cond_ex15_3","level":"advanced","group":15,"gord":15,"no":3,"instruction":"Read the following situations, then make sentences using would rather or had better.","q":"3. You want to be left alone to read and don't want to go to the cinema.","options":["A) I'd rather be left alone to read than go to the cinema.","B) I'd rather to be left alone to read than going to the cinema.","C) I'd rather being left alone to read than go to the cinema.","D) I'd rather I had been left alone to read than to go to the cinema."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Той самий підмет: would rather + bare infinitive + than + bare infinitive."}$g1729$, 62, $g1730$cond_rather$g1730$),
  ($g1731$cond_ex15_4$g1731$, $g1732$abcd$g1732$, $g1733$advanced$g1733$, $g1734${"id":"cond_ex15_4","level":"advanced","group":15,"gord":15,"no":4,"instruction":"Read the following situations, then make sentences using would rather or had better.","q":"4. It would be more sensible for you to go and rest for an hour.","options":["A) You had better go and rest for an hour.","B) You had better to go and rest for an hour.","C) You had better going to rest for an hour.","D) You would better go and rest for an hour."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Had better + bare infinitive: порада з тиском."}$g1734$, 63, $g1735$cond_rather$g1735$),
  ($g1736$cond_ex15_5$g1736$, $g1737$abcd$g1737$, $g1738$advanced$g1738$, $g1739${"id":"cond_ex15_5","level":"advanced","group":15,"gord":15,"no":5,"instruction":"Read the following situations, then make sentences using would rather or had better.","q":"5. I would prefer to spend more time in Spain and not go home.","options":["A) I'd rather spend more time in Spain than go home.","B) I'd rather to spend more time in Spain than going home.","C) I'd rather spending more time in Spain than go home.","D) I'd rather spend more time in Spain than to go home."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Would rather: обидві частини без to."}$g1739$, 64, $g1740$cond_rather$g1740$),
  ($g1741$cond_ex15_6$g1741$, $g1742$abcd$g1742$, $g1743$advanced$g1743$, $g1744${"id":"cond_ex15_6","level":"advanced","group":15,"gord":15,"no":6,"instruction":"Read the following situations, then make sentences using would rather or had better.","q":"6. We should have waited for him at home.","options":["A) It would have been better if we had waited for him at home.","B) It would have been better if we waited for him at home.","C) It would be better if we had waited for him at home.","D) It would have been better if we would have waited for him at home."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Для минулого had better не вживаємо: It would have been better if + Past Perfect."}$g1744$, 65, $g1745$cond_rather$g1745$),
  ($g1746$cond_ex15_7$g1746$, $g1747$abcd$g1747$, $g1748$advanced$g1748$, $g1749${"id":"cond_ex15_7","level":"advanced","group":15,"gord":15,"no":7,"instruction":"Read the following situations, then make sentences using would rather or had better.","q":"7. Mary always wears horrible orange lipstick. You wish she wouldn't.","options":["A) I'd rather Mary didn't wear horrible orange lipstick.","B) I'd rather Mary doesn't wear horrible orange lipstick.","C) I'd rather Mary wouldn't wear horrible orange lipstick.","D) I'd rather Mary not to wear horrible orange lipstick."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Інший підмет після would rather: Past Simple."}$g1749$, 66, $g1750$cond_rather$g1750$),
  ($g1751$cond_ex15_8$g1751$, $g1752$abcd$g1752$, $g1753$advanced$g1753$, $g1754${"id":"cond_ex15_8","level":"advanced","group":15,"gord":15,"no":8,"instruction":"Read the following situations, then make sentences using would rather or had better.","q":"8. Your friend turns up late and you are angry with him.","options":["A) You had better not be late again.","B) You had better not to be late again.","C) You had better don't be late again.","D) You would better not be late again."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Had better not + bare infinitive: попередження."}$g1754$, 67, $g1755$cond_rather$g1755$),
  ($g1756$cond_exOD10_1$g1756$, $g1757$abcd$g1757$, $g1758$intermediate$g1758$, $g1759${"id":"cond_exOD10_1","level":"intermediate","group":"OD10","gord":20,"no":1,"groupTitle":"Oral Development 10","instruction":"Look at the pictures, then make sentences using conditionals or wishes to say what each person is thinking. (Choose the best thought.)","q":"1. Школярка пізно ввечері робить домашнє завдання. Що вона думає?","options":["A) I wish I didn't have so much homework.","B) I wish I hadn't so much homework yesterday.","C) I wish I wouldn't have so much homework.","D) I wish I don't have so much homework."],"correct":0,"explanation":"Теперішня ситуація: wish + Past Simple."}$g1759$, 68, $g1760$cond_mix$g1760$),
  ($g1761$cond_exOD10_2$g1761$, $g1762$abcd$g1762$, $g1763$intermediate$g1763$, $g1764${"id":"cond_exOD10_2","level":"intermediate","group":"OD10","gord":20,"no":2,"groupTitle":"Oral Development 10","instruction":"Look at the pictures, then make sentences using conditionals or wishes to say what each person is thinking. (Choose the best thought.)","q":"2. Дівчинка сидить сама й сумує. Що вона думає?","options":["A) If only I had someone to talk to.","B) If only I have someone to talk to.","C) If only I would have someone to talk to.","D) If only I had had someone to talk to now."],"correct":0,"explanation":"If only + Past Simple — жаль про теперішнє."}$g1764$, 69, $g1765$cond_mix$g1765$),
